<title>USA: Sublette CSD 1, Wyo., won by Dain Bosworth.</title>
<headline>Sublette CSD 1, Wyo., won by Dain Bosworth.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth said it won $2.100 million of Sublette Cty SD 1, Wyo., general obligation bonds, Series 1996, general obligation bonds, Series 1996, with a net interest cost of 4.69 percent.</p>
